      "lines": [
        "а) $(2x+y)(2x+y)+(x-y)(y-x)$；",
        "б) $10(2a^4-3b^4)-(4a^2-5b^2)(5a^2+6b^2)$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "972",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "972．下列哪些式子的值：1）对于任意自然数 $n$，都能被5整",
        "除；2）只对某些整数 $n$，能被5整除；3）对于任意整数",
        "$n$，都不能被5整除？",
        "а) $(2n+3)(3n-7)-(n+1)(n-1)$；",
        "б) $(7n+8)(n-1)+(3n-2)(n+2)$；",
        "в) $(6n+1)(n+5)-(3n+5)(2n-1)$；",
        "г) $(n^2+3n-1)(n+2)-n^3+2$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "973",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "973．下列哪些式子的值与 $x$ 无关？",
        "а) $(2x^2-x-10)(x-3)-(x^2-5x+4)(2x+3)$；",
        "б) $(x+1)(x^2-x+1)-(x-1)(x^2+x+1)$；",
        "в) $(x+5)(x+4)(x-2)-(x^2+11x-9)(x+1)$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "974",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "974．解方程：",
        "а) $(x+2)(x-5)=(x+1)(x+6)$；",
        "б) $(2y-7)(6y+5)=(3y-4)(4y-6)$；",
        "в) $(1-8x)(7x+9)=87-56x^2$；",
        "г) $(y-2)(y^2+5y-9)=(y+3)(y^2-19)$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "975",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "975．如果矩形的长减少$4\\text{ cm}$，宽增加$5\\text{ cm}$，结果得到一个正",
        "方形，这个正方形面积比矩形面积大$40\\text{ cm}^2$．求矩形",
        "面积．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "976",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "976．矩形周长等于36米．如果这个矩形的长增加1米，宽",
        "增加2米，那么面积增加30米$^2$．求原来矩形的面积．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "977",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "977．矩形的周长等于30分米．如果这个矩形的长减少8分",
        "米，宽增加5分米，那么矩形的面积减少8分米$^2$．求原",
        "来矩形的面积．"
      ]
    },
